}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的物块（可视为质点）从 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 点水平抛出，恰好在 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 点无碰撞进入圆弧管道，速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{A}} = 3\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，到 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 点时对管道的压力为 "},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}} = 7.8\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。物块经过轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 后滑上平板并带动平板一起运动，若平板到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"DD'"},{"type":"text","value":" 即被锁定，物块继续滑动。已知物块与平板上表面之间、物块与 "},{"type":"math","value":"DE"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间的动摩擦因数均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ} = 0.6"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos 37^{\\circ} = 0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）求物块从 P 到 A 的运动时间 t;\n(2) 求 AB 管道对物块的摩擦力做的功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W_{f}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）若平板长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=\\frac{1}{3}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求物块在得分区滑行的距离 x；\n(4) 为使物块能够滑入得分区内，平板长度 L 应满足什么要求？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b3dc728b9ba6bf8daef17f54af41eb59db969218a52661e366b3a97f9219588c.png","width":691,"height":387,"width_mm":81.115,"row_group":"hangzhou-yimo-2511-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数：重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.（11分）\n（1）在 A 点恰好进入圆弧轨道时，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{Ay} = v_{A} \\cos 37^{\\circ} = 2.4 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n从"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"的时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t = \\frac{v_{Ay}}{g} = 0.24\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分）\n（2）由牛顿第三定律，滑块在"},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"点受到轨道的支持力"},{"type":"math","value":"F = F_{\\mathrm{N}} = 7.8\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"滑块在 B 点时，对其受力分析，"},{"type":"math","value":"F - mg = \\frac{mv_{B}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{B} = 4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n滑块由 A 到 B 由动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"mgR(1 + \\sin 37^{\\circ}) + W_{f} = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{B}^{2} - \\frac{1}{2}mv_{A}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"W_{f}=-3.75J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）滑块滑上平板时的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C}=v_{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"，从刚滑上平板到与平板共速，相对木板的位移大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由动量守恒及能量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"{m v _ {C} = (m + \\lambda L) v _ {1}};\\quad {\\frac {1}{2} m v _ {C} ^ {2} = \\frac {1}{2} (m + \\lambda L) v _ {1} ^ {2} + \\mu m g s _ {1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{1}=\\frac{1}{3}m,\\quad v_{1}=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n即物块与平板共速时刚好滑到平板右端，滑上得分区时速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}=v_{1}=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"在得分区"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{D}^{2}=2\\mu gx"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得x=0.75m（1分）\n（4）滑块能滑入得分区内，需满足条件：\n（i）当平板较短时，临界情况是滑块滑到板右端与板共速。要求滑块不脱离平板，则由（3）解答可知："},{"type":"math","value":"L \\geq \\frac{1}{3} m"},{"type":"text","value":"。（1分）\n（ii）当平板较长时，临界情况是平板锁定后，滑块恰好在平板右端减速至0。\n从滑块离开 C 点到与平板共速，根据动量守恒定律："},{"type":"math","value":"m v _ {C} = (m + \\lambda L) v _ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"设滑块相对平板的位移大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"s_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由能量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} m v _ {C} ^ {2} = \\frac {1}{2} (m + \\lambda L) v _ {2} ^ {2} + \\mu m g s _ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"平板被"},{"type":"math","value":"DD'"},{"type":"text","value":"锁定时，滑块距离平板右端"},{"type":"math","value":"L - s_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则："},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {2} ^ {2} = 2 \\mu g (L - s _ {2})"},{"type":"text","value":"由以上三式解得"},{"type":"math","value":"L = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"故"},{"type":"math","value":"L \\leq 1m"},{"type":"text","value":"。(1分)\n综上，应满足"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{3}\\mathrm{m}\\leq L\\leq 1\\mathrm{m}"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2511-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-shoukao--hangzhou-yimo-2511","source_question_id":"hangzhou-yimo-2511-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7c9c4cb10c5e5f0e16e61cf9cb296186573d1cab7afb2d8ad5d2320c54ff633f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）如图，某测速装置中的一个竖直轮子由细圆环与辐条构成，细圆环质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 、半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" ，辐条质量不计。当轮子匀速转动时，固定在轮子上的轻质小圆柱可带动“工”形支架在竖直方向做简谐运动。“工”形支架质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，其下端的金属横杆与平行导轨垂直且紧密接触。导轨间距也为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" ，下端接有阻值为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 的定值电阻，整个导轨处于磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向垂直纸面向里的匀强磁场中。现对轮子施加外力，使轮子以角速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 顺时针匀速转动，当图示中的小圆柱转动到左侧与轮子中心等高处开始计时（ "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" ），此时金属横杆与导轨底部距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2r"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知重力加速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"g"},{"type":"text","value":" ，除定值电阻外其余电阻均忽略不计，空气阻力、摩擦阻力不计，电路中电流的磁场忽略不计。（1）求 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，支架向上运动的速度大小和横杆的电动势；（2）求横杆中电流随时间变化的关系（以向左为电流的正方向）；（3）求从 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 起，轮子转过 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 圈过程中，轮子对支架做的功；（4）若 "},{"type":"math","value":"t = 0"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，撤去外力，同时在极短时间内使磁场的磁感应强度减小到0，求磁感应强度减为0瞬间，轮子的角速度大小（可能用到微元累积公式 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum x\\Delta x = \\frac{1}{2} x^2"},{"type":"text","value":" ）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/305bfac7ac6bca38f480a515def13d73662c56ee0ef39452e9627ee90f206f3f.png","width