alue":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 很小， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos \\theta \\approx 1"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta \\approx \\tan \\theta \\approx \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" ）的直磁感线。已知电子束垂直通道的左侧端面入射，入射时电子束关于 "},{"type":"math","value":"OO'"},{"type":"text","value":" 对称，其直径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" ，某个位于电子束边缘的电子从 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 点射入并从 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 点离开。求圆柱体长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 的最小值以及 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 取最小值时电子束从右端面飞出时的直径。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c39d28c35b73204f0948b32e562c6b22a7b3d9a69dcc6f2bf5c121be83f5327e.png","width":887,"height":598,"width_mm":104.123,"row_group":"hangzhou-yimo-2511-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）\n解析：（1）电场加速"},{"type":"math","value":"eU=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2分），可得"},{"type":"math","value":"U=\\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{2e}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）电子打到"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"点时运动轨迹及几何关系如图所示。由左手定则知，磁场垂直纸面向外（1分）\n由几何关系得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\alpha = \\frac{1}{2}, \\alpha = \\frac{\\pi}{6}, \\tan \\frac{\\alpha}{2} = \\frac{R}{r_1}"},{"type":"math","value":"eBv_{0} = \\frac{mv_{0}^{2}}{r_{1}}, r_{1} = \\frac{mv_{0}}{eB}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）可得"},{"type":"math","value":"B = \\frac{(2 - \\sqrt{3})mv_{0}}{eR}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/499f847a226d45da5b3e9eb8271c6802eb724dfd5478364f6cd7c9a4fd9fca78.png","width":420,"height":337,"width_mm":53.2},{"type":"text","value":"（3）亮点做匀速圆周运动，角速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\omega = \\frac{\\pi}{3T}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）偏转角随时间变化规律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\beta = \\frac{\\pi}{6} -\\frac{\\pi}{3T} t"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan \\frac{\\beta}{2} = \\frac{R}{r_2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"math","value":"r_2 = \\frac{mv_0}{eB},"},{"type":"math","value":"B = \\frac{mv_0}{eR}\\tan \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12} -\\frac{\\pi}{6T} t\\right),t <   T"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（4）把电子速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"分别沿垂直于磁感线方向和沿磁感线方向分解，沿磁感线方向"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x} = v_{0} \\cos \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，电子做匀速运动\n垂直于磁感线方向，电子做匀速圆周运动，周期为"},{"type":"math","value":"T \\approx \\frac{2\\pi m}{eB_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n电子转一圈刚好运动到 N，a 取最小值，"},{"type":"math","value":"a_{\\min}=v_{x}T\\cdot\\cos\\theta\\approx\\frac{2\\pi mv_{0}}{eB_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n所有电子均垂直于入射处的磁感线做圆周运动，同时沿磁感线做匀速直线运动，并从磁感线的右端离开磁透镜，周期均为"},{"type":"math","value":"T \\approx \\frac{2\\pi m}{eB_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以电子束从右端面飞出时直径为"},{"type":"math","value":"D=b-2\\cdot v_{x}T\\cdot\\sin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"或者"},{"type":"math","value":"D=b-2\\cdot a_{\\min}\\cdot\\tan\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"D = b - \\frac{4\\pi\\theta mv_{0}}{eB_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}}]}
